12: /// fifth holistic read before hostile validation round 12, finding d3): the redeploy of 2026-11-04 failed after the
13: /// replacement, and its recovery restored a unit file that still named the removed legacy apphost, so the service could
14: /// not start until a manual retarget. These rows state the recovery the criterion needs: restore the preserved state,
15: /// then retarget a unit file or drop-in that names the legacy apphost and reload systemd after that change; a unit that
