13: /// compares a requested environment with the process environment takes that baseline as an explicit input, and its
14: /// unit contract supplies both maps; operator 2026-10-29: "Strengthen ACs, fix both (Recommended)"; hostile validation
15: /// round 8b finding R8B-F1) and TEST-MCP-TRIAGE-003 (desktop process launches pass only explicit environment deltas).
16: /// Test data: scripted requested maps and baseline maps with the delta each must give, run against builders passed in,
